      "writtenOn": "2026-08-07T11:16:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we should move the rollback after the `if (!(update \u0026 GITS_BASER_VALID))` check and if the host tries to play tricks on us with read-modify-write during rollback, we still have the source of truth from the original table and we are not giving back any other page to host.",
      "parentUuid": "e811a8b8_e69fd734",
